    <dcterms:title xml:lang="en">prettyModel restrictions</dcterms:title>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">This artefact provides the restrictions and inference-related specifications for the prettyModel demonstration ontology.
        This artefact excludes the definitions of concepts.
        prettyModel is a sample non-ePO UML conceptual model used to exercise the model2owl transformation pipeline in CI.</rdfs:label>
